title: Maybe notes should earn their way downward.
pid: 5ef0aa80-0e12-4fe8-9b88-59e746110475
body: |2-
  But I prefer a more explicitly structured approach:
  in each container R that I want to sort,
  keep an 'unsorted' content branch
    where I can quickly put new thoughts,
  and a 'sorting into' content branch
    that I sort both 'unsorted' and R into.

  Maybe the 'sorting into' should just be R itself.
